{
  "id": 11,
  "title": "When Everyone Started Talking About Us",
  "subtitle": "The World Noticed Before We Did",
  "date": "July – October 2025",
  "quote": "The world noticed our bond long before we understood what it truly meant.",
  "endQuote": "The campus called it love. We simply called it being there for each other.",
  "image": "/images/chapter11.jpg",
  "music": "/audio/chapter11.mp3",
  "atmosphere": "particles",
  "readingTime": 5,
  "content": [
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "As the months passed, Grace and I became inseparable." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "If someone was looking for Grace..." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "They usually found Hari nearby." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "If someone was searching for Hari..." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Grace wasn't far away." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "We attended events together." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Walked across campus together." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Studied together." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Laughed together." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Supported each other through difficult days." },
    { "type": "section-break" },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Slowly..." },
    { "type": "emphasis", "text": "People started noticing." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "At first, it was just teasing from our friends." },
    { "type": "dialogue", "text": "\"Where's Grace?\"" },
    { "type": "dialogue", "text": "\"Hari, your partner isn't here today?\"" },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "We laughed and ignored it." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "But soon..." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "The rumors spread across campus." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "People started saying," },
    { "type": "dialogue", "text": "\"Hari and Grace are in love.\"" },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Whenever someone asked me about it, I simply smiled." },
    { "type": "section-break" },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "The truth was..." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Even I didn't know how to define our relationship." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Was it friendship?" },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Was it love?" },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Or was it something even more beautiful than both?" },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "I didn't have an answer." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "But one thing was certain." },
    { "type": "emphasis", "text": "Grace had become the first person I wanted to share every happy moment with." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Whenever I achieved something..." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "I wanted to tell her first." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Whenever I felt low..." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "She was the first person I thought of." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "The same was true for her." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "She trusted me with her worries." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Her happiness." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Her fears." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Her dreams." },
    { "type": "emphasis", "text": "Without realizing it... we had become each other's comfort." },
    { "type": "section-break" },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "People gave our relationship different names." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "But we never did." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Because sometimes..." },
    { "type": "emphasis", "text": "The most beautiful relationships don't need a definition. They simply need two hearts that genuinely care for each other." }
  ]
}
